<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= css () : string =\n    \"\"\":root { --ink: #1d1b2e; --paper: #faf8f2; --accent: #6b4fd8; --muted: #6f6a80; --rule: #e4dfd2; }\n        * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n        body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font: 17px/1.65 system-ui, sans-serif; }\n        header { padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }\n        header .home { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }\n        main { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px 80px; }\n        .tabs { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 28px; }\n        .tabs a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; }\n        .featured { border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 36px; }\n        .badge { color: var(--accent); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; }\n        .year { font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-bottom: 6px; }\n        ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; }\n        .post time, .kind { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; margin-right: 12px; }\n        .post a { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }\n        .post-title { font-size: 42px; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 12px; padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 4px solid var(--accent); }\n        .byline { color: var(--muted); }\n        .toc { border-left: 3px solid var(--rule); padding-left: 16px; margin: 28px 0; font-size: 15px; }\n        .section-rule { border: 0; text-align: center; margin: 40px 0; }\n        .section-rule::before { content: \"* * *\"; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 8px; }\n        pre { background: #16141f; color: #ece8f8; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; overflow-x: auto; font-size: 14px; }\n        .terminal .prompt { color: var(--accent); }\n        table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 20px 0; }\n        th, td { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left; }\n        .note { border-left: 4px solid #d8a14f; background: #fbf1df; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 4px; }\n        \"\"\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ":= css () : string =\n    \"\"\":root { --ink: #1d1b2e; --paper: #faf8f2; --accent: #6b4fd8; --muted: #6f6a80; --rule: #e4dfd2; }\n        * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n        body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font: 17px/1.65 system-ui, sans-serif; }\n        header { padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }\n        header .home { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }\n        main { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px 80px; }\n        .tabs { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 28px; }\n        .tabs a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; }\n        .featured { border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 36px; }\n        .badge { color: var(--accent); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; }\n        .year { font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-bottom: 6px; }\n        ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; }\n        .post time, .kind { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; margin-right: 12px; }\n        .post a { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }\n        .post-title { font-size: 42px; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 12px; padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 4px solid var(--accent); }\n        .byline { color: var(--muted); }\n        .toc { border-left: 3px solid var(--rule); padding-left: 16px; margin: 28px 0; font-size: 15px; }\n        .section-rule { border: 0; text-align: center; margin: 40px 0; }\n        .section-rule::before { content: \"* * *\"; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 8px; }\n        pre { background: #16141f; color: #ece8f8; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; overflow-x: auto; font-size: 14px; }\n        .terminal .prompt { color: var(--accent); }\n        table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 20px 0; }\n        th, td { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left; }\n        .note { border-left: 4px solid #d8a14f; background: #fbf1df; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 4px; }\n        \"\"\"",
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### the_stylesheet_defines_the_palette (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n\ncss () |> sm'.starts_with \":root { --ink:\" |> _assert_eq !+","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test

  css () |> sm'.starts_with ":root { --ink:" |> _assert_eq !+
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```
